WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.623
We will move from concepts to implementation
gradually First

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:11.309
we build the relational mental model You will
identify entities attributes row

00:00:11.323 --> 00:00:17.036
grain keys and relationships Then we focus on
protection

00:00:17.972 --> 00:00:22.209
Constraints and normalization help keep the data
consistent even when many users

00:00:22.236 --> 00:00:27.789
or applications interact with the database After
that we connect

00:00:27.816 --> 00:00:32.924
the design to PostgreSQL You will run completed
examples before you are

00:00:32.937 --> 00:00:38.511
asked to change or write small pieces yourself The
coding progression is

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:44.216
intentional run change complete and then write You
are not

00:00:44.229 --> 00:00:49.258
expected to memorize a long CREATE TABLE script
Instead learn how to

00:00:49.271 --> 00:00:51.995
read the pieces and explain why each one exists
